<%# The title is the document's first line, on the page itself rather than in
    the chrome above it. Broadcast-replaced when the title changes; its
    .plan-document__head parent is never a stream target, so the editor and
    the sticky nav watch that to re-bind after a replace. %>
<div class="plan-title" id="plan-title">
  <h1 class="plan-title__heading"><%= plan.title %></h1>
</div>
